*.env
*.env.*
!*.env.example

source-material
docs/archive/planning-history

# --- ask-mesha-agent only: the image ships a read-only repo snapshot at /repo,
# so strip anything secret-ish or heavy that the agent never needs to read.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/service-account*.json
**/*-sa.json
**/credentials*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/.pgenv
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/secrets
**/.secrets
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.gradle
**/.idea
**/.vscode
.codex*
apps/mobile/**/build
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.ipa
# Bulky evidence / artifacts / raw data dumps the agent never needs (keep source + docs text).
docs/runbooks/evidence
docs/prototypes/config-sop-studio/research
**/artifacts
apps/goatos-android/docs/screenshot-gallery
fixtures
**/*.docx
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
**/*.gif
**/*.mp4
